Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,CRM ka doosra section — Targets.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.04,0:00:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Har customer ke liye ek annual target set kar sakte hain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.69,0:00:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Manually customer wise ya bulk mein — Bulk % Target button dabaakar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.03,0:00:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Pichhle FY ki sales ke upar 10 percent 20 percent ya jo bhi percentage
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.51,0:00:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,sab customers ke liye ek saath set ho jaayega.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.45,0:00:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Har row mein pichhle FY sales, target, current FY achievement, aur percentage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.43,0:00:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Neeche monthly split bhi hai — April se March tak, har month ki sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.91,0:00:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Excel export kariye — poora target report ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.97,0:00:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sales meeting mein use kariye — kaun peeche hai, kise push karna hai — clear.
